===Noun===
{{en-noun|abbr=blvd.,blvd,bd.,bd,bl}}

# A broad, well-paved and landscaped [[thoroughfare]].
#: {{ux|en|We live on {{w|Sunset Boulevard|Sunset '''Boulevard'''}}.}}
